sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SA as Super Admin
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant C as AuditLogController
    participant ALog as AuditLog Model
    participant DB as Database

    SA->>UI: Buka Audit Log
    UI->>C: GET /admin/audit-logs
    %% note over C: Opsi: filter by user, action, resource, date range
    C->>ALog: Ambil data log (opsional filter)
    ALog->>DB: SELECT audit_logs (paged)
    DB-->>ALog: Data log
    ALog-->>C: Hasil query
    C-->>UI: Response paginated
    UI-->>SA: Tampilkan tabel log



